      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "BLUF",
      "narration_text": "It's tempting to say a model makes things up because it's broken. It makes things up because it predicts, not checks. It learns which words tend to follow which. Truth is a different question it was never directly asked.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "lane": "remotion",
        "motion": "type-on",
        "show": [
