    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "WORKED_EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "Here's the smallest model I could build. It reads three true sentences: Paris is the capital of France, Berlin of Germany, Rome of Italy. It only learns which word follows which. Then I asked what it would say after Paris is the capital of. Every continuation it can produce is on the right.",
