    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "FALSIFIABILITY",
      "narration_text": "So what helps? Ground the model: give it the source text to answer from, the R A G idea. Ask for citations, and actually open them. Tell it that I don't know is an acceptable answer. And for anything that matters, names, numbers, dates and quotes, check it yourself. Prediction is the engine. Checking is your job.",
